{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "registryId": "es-skill-aispace-output-bindings",
  "authority": "project-skill-registration",
  "purpose": "为会生成或缓存内容的 Skill 声明稳定的 AISpace 输出绑定；该文件是注册契约，不授予额外写入权限。",
  "canonicalConcept": "AISpace",
  "authorityIdentity": "ES/AISpace/AISPACE_AUTHORITY.json",
  "bodyAuthority": "ES/AISpace/README.md",
  "relationProjection": "ES/AISpace/Public/Skills/registry.json",
  "skillContractPattern": ".agents/skills/<skill-name>/governance.json",
  "canonicalRoots": {
    "privateTemp": "ES/AISpace/Local/<category>/<YYYYMMDD>/<agent-or-task>/",
    "publicIndex": "ES/AISpace/Public/<category>/<YYYYMMDD>/<topic-or-task>/",
    "unityPublic": "Assets/ES/AISpace/Public/<category>/<YYYYMMDD>/<domain>/",
    "privateContent": "ES/AISpace/Local/<category>/<YYYYMMDD>/<agent-or-task>/",
    "publicContent": "ES/AISpace/Public/<category>/<YYYYMMDD>/<topic-or-task>/"
  },
  "legacyPathAliases": [
    {
      "legacyPath": "Assets/ES/Space/Public",
      "canonicalConcept": "AISpace/UnityPublic",
      "desiredPath": "Assets/ES/AISpace/Public",
      "status": "migrated",
      "automaticRename": false
    }
  ],
  "bindingRules": [
    "Skill 本体始终保留在 .agents/skills/<skill-name>/；绑定只描述产物或缓存落点。",
    "所有 AISpace 内容必须先选择 category，再选择 YYYYMMDD 日期和 owner；不得按日期建立无分类根目录。",
    "private-temp/private-content 使用 Local/<category>/<YYYYMMDD>/<agent-or-task>/；temporary、stable、archived 均可保留。",
    "public-index/public-content 使用 Public/<category>/<YYYYMMDD>/<topic-or-task>/；外部权威产物只保存索引，不复制第二份。",
    "unity-public 统一使用 Assets/ES/AISpace/Public/<category>/<YYYYMMDD>/<domain>/ 出口；旧路径仅保留为迁移兼容别名。",
    "每条绑定必须同时指向 Skill governance.json 与 AISpace 关系投影；关系投影由脚本重建，不作为写入授权。"
  ],
